898
01:05:07.468 --> 01:05:09.871
That feeling. It's not real.

899
01:05:10.105 --> 01:05:12.842
- I love you.
- I love you, too. Sure.

900
01:05:15.444 --> 01:05:17.411
But can you tell me one thing
that is different

901
01:05:17.678 --> 01:05:20.715
