and I have a feeling?

902
01:05:22.116 --> 01:05:23.852
- Everything's different.
- Well, yeah.

903
01:05:24.051 --> 01:05:25.720
To you. In your head.

904
01:05:27.223 --> 01:05:30.292
Sunrise at a different time?
Weather patterns shifted?

905
