It's cortisol, oxytocin,
dopamine. It's a trick.

906
01:05:37.165 --> 01:05:39.268
It's like believing in God.

907
01:05:40.368 --> 01:05:42.270
What's happening right now?

908
01:05:43.906 --> 01:05:46.408
You went to space...

909
01:05:47.743 --> 01:05:49.110
