1257
01:30:33.861 --> 01:30:34.661
Lucy.

1258
01:30:35.060 --> 01:30:38.632
Is there anybody that you
can talk to? A doctor, maybe?

1259
01:30:40.000 --> 01:30:42.970
It's too bad we never got
