1380
01:39:04.203 --> 01:39:05.205
LUCY OVER PHONE: <i>Sir.</i>

1381
01:39:05.671 --> 01:39:09.242
<i>I won't lie. Being up there,
the experience...</i>

1382
01:39:10.042 --> 01:39:11.076
<i>I wasn't ready.</i>

1383
01:39:11.411 --> 01:39:14.381
<i>I mean, I... I was ready
for the job. I did the job.</i>

1384
01:39:14.714 --> 01:39:16.248
<i>But the experience...</i>

1385
01:39:16.715 --> 01:39:17.783
<i>But I get it now.</i>

1386
01:39:18.385 --> 01:39:22.188
<i>It's not just a job, sir.
I, uh... I thought it was.</i>

1387
01:39:22.255 --> 01:39:24.658
<i>But then I went, and now I know.</i>

1388
01:39:26.292 --> 01:39:27.693
It's a purpose.

1389
01:39:28.961 --> 01:39:30.464
It's my purpose.

1390
01:39:31.898 --> 01:39:34.034
<i>You know sometimes
on the old Apollo missions...</i>

1391
01:39:34.434 --> 01:39:38.171
<i>the bird would just, you know,
get off course. Just a little.</i>

1392
01:39:38.304 --> 01:39:40.139
And you'd need to bring
thrusters online

1393
01:39:40.206 --> 01:39:42.075
