the chicken crossed the road.</i>

1505
01:50:15.608 --> 01:50:17.911
<i>To get to the other side.</i>

1506
01:50:19.379 --> 01:50:21.080
<i>To explore.</i>

1507
01:50:24.317 --> 01:50:26.185
