1512
01:50:54.514 --> 01:50:57.016
(police siren wails)

1513
01:50:57.616 --> 01:51:00.153
OFFICER 3: <i>Keep your hands
where I can see them.</i>

1514
01:51:01.953 --> 01:51:04.357
<i>Keep your hands
where I can see them.</i>

1515
